<title>HONG KONG: Wah Tak Fung debuts at HK$1.92 per share.</title>
<headline>Wah Tak Fung debuts at HK$1.92 per share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hong Kong-based property group Wah Tak Fung Holdings Ltd made their trading debut at HK$1.92 in Hong Kong on Monday, compared with their issue price of HK$1.88 per share.  </p>
<p>Wah Tak Fung offered 138 million new shares earlier this month at HK$1.88 per share, raising a net HK$245 million to fund its purchase of land and properties interests.</p>
<p>Its flotation was 10.6 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Wah Tak Fung has a land bank of 44,700 sq. metres with the existing properties valued at HK$2.565 billion as at June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
